<section class="wswakeband__s"><div class="wswakeband__v"><div class="wswakeband__kicker wswakeband__c">Iskustva kupaca</div><h2 class="wswakeband__h2 wswakeband__c">Pogledajte ga <em>u stvarnom životu</em></h2><p class="wswakeband__p wswakeband__c">Kupci pokazuju kako nose narukvicu, kako se postavlja alarm i kako izgleda jutro bez glasne budilice. Bez scenarija – samo ljudi kojima je dosadilo prespavati.</p><p class="wswakeband__p wswakeband__c">Prolistajte videe i pogledajte koliko je narukvica mala i lagana na ruci, i koliko je jednostavno namjestiti vrijeme buđenja izravno na njoj.</p><div class="wswakeband__grid wswakeband__g3 wswakeband__kar"><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__km wswakeband__km--v"><video src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-video-1.mp4' ); ?>" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"></video></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__km wswakeband__km--v"><video src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-video-2.mp4' ); ?>" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"></video></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__km wswakeband__km--v"><video src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-video-3.mp4' ); ?>" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"></video></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__km wswakeband__km--v"><video src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-video-4.mp4' ); ?>" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"></video></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__km wswakeband__km--v"><video src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-video-5.mp4' ); ?>" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"></video></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__km wswakeband__km--v"><video src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-video-6.mp4' ); ?>" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"></video></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__km wswakeband__km--v"><video src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-video-7.mp4' ); ?>" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"></video></div></div></div><p class="wswakeband__zak">Mala narukvica, veliki pomak – jutra bez prespavanja.</p></div></section>
<section class="wswakeband__s wswakeband__s--bg"><div class="wswakeband__v"><div class="wswakeband__kicker wswakeband__c">Prave priče</div><h2 class="wswakeband__h2 wswakeband__c">Što kažu <em>čvrsti spavači</em></h2><p class="wswakeband__p wswakeband__c">Kratko i jasno – ovo su rečenice koje najčešće čujemo od ljudi koji su glasnu budilicu zamijenili vibracijom na zapešću.</p><div class="wswakeband__grid wswakeband__g3"><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__kt"><p>„Pravi preokret za nas koji spavamo kao zaklani.&quot;</p><span class="wswakeband__ime"><i class="wswakeband__av" aria-hidden="true">K</i>Krešimir L.</span></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__kt"><p>„Supruga napokon prespava moj alarm.&quot;</p><span class="wswakeband__ime"><i class="wswakeband__av" aria-hidden="true">R</i>Robert M.</span></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__kt"><p>„Najbolja kupnja ove godine.&quot;</p><span class="wswakeband__ime"><i class="wswakeband__av" aria-hidden="true">J</i>Josip P.</span></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__kt"><p>„Radi čak i kad spavam najdublje.&quot;</p><span class="wswakeband__ime"><i class="wswakeband__av" aria-hidden="true">A</i>Ante T.</span></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__kt"><p>„Napokon na vrijeme na jutarnjim sastancima.&quot;</p><span class="wswakeband__ime"><i class="wswakeband__av" aria-hidden="true">T</i>Tomislav B.</span></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__kt"><p>„Bez straha da ću prespavati alarm na mobitelu.&quot;</p><span class="wswakeband__ime"><i class="wswakeband__av" aria-hidden="true">S</i>Siniša B.</span></div></div></div><p class="wswakeband__zak">Jedna stvar im je zajednička: više ne prespavaju.</p></div></section>
<section class="wswakeband__s"><div class="wswakeband__v wswakeband__dva"><div class="wswakeband__media"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-vibracija.webp' ); ?>" alt="Preuzmite kontrolu nad svojim jutrima" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div><div class="wswakeband__kicker">Posebno razvijena vibracija</div><h2 class="wswakeband__h2">Preuzmite kontrolu nad <em>svojim jutrima</em></h2><p class="wswakeband__p">Većina budilica ne uspijeva probuditi čvrste spavače jer mozak nauči ignorirati zvuk. Isti ton ste čuli stotine puta, pa ga mozak filtrira prije nego što ga uopće svjesno registrirate.</p><p class="wswakeband__p">NORIKS WakeBand radi drugačije: vibrira izravno na zapešću. To je fizički osjet koji mozak ne može tek tako isključiti, ma koliko duboko spavali – a pritom ostaje tih za sve ostale u sobi.</p><ul class="wswakeband__kv"><li><em>Budite se na vrijeme, svaki put</em> – bez prespavanja i bez stiskanja odgode</li><li><em>Nježna vibracija, ne kreštava budilica</em> – dovoljno jaka da prekine dubok san, bez panike</li><li><em>Bez ometanja drugih</em> – partner ili cimeri spavaju dalje</li><li><em>Mirnija jutra</em> – budite se smireni, a ne pod stresom čim otvorite oči</li></ul><p class="wswakeband__zak">Vibracija na zapešću – budi samo vas.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="wswakeband__s wswakeband__traka wswakeband__s--bg"><div class="wswakeband__v wswakeband__tmreza"><div class="wswakeband__tk"><span class="wswakeband__ti"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12a8 8 0 1 0 2.4-5.7"/><path d="M4 4v4.5h4.5"/><path d="M12 8v4l2.6 2"/></svg></span><div class="wswakeband__tt"><strong>30 dana za povrat</strong><span>isprobajte bez rizika</span></div></div><div class="wswakeband__tk"><span class="wswakeband__ti"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.5h11v9h-11z"/><path d="M13.5 9.5h4l3 3.2v2.8h-7"/><circle cx="7" cy="17.5" r="1.8"/><circle cx="17" cy="17.5" r="1.8"/></svg></span><div class="wswakeband__tt"><strong>Besplatna dostava</strong><span>za narudžbe iznad 70 €</span></div></div><div class="wswakeband__tk"><span class="wswakeband__ti"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3.2"/><path d="M3 20c0-3.3 2.7-6 6-6s6 2.7 6 6"/><circle cx="17" cy="9" r="2.6"/><path d="M16 14.2c2.9.3 5 2.8 5 5.8"/></svg></span><div class="wswakeband__tt"><strong>120.000 kupaca</strong><span>u cijeloj regiji</span></div></div><div class="wswakeband__tk"><span class="wswakeband__ti"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2.5" y="6" width="19" height="12" rx="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2.6"/><path d="M6 9.5v5M18 9.5v5"/></svg></span><div class="wswakeband__tt"><strong>Plaćanje pouzećem</strong><span>bez kartice, pri preuzimanju</span></div></div></div></section>
<section class="wswakeband__s"><div class="wswakeband__v wswakeband__dva wswakeband__dva--rev"><div class="wswakeband__media wswakeband__media--cela"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-usporedba.webp' ); ?>" alt="Nije pametnija budilica. Ona vas stvarno probudi." loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div><div class="wswakeband__kicker">Usporedba</div><h2 class="wswakeband__h2">Nije pametnija budilica. <em>Ona vas stvarno probudi.</em></h2><p class="wswakeband__p">Alarm na mobitelu budi cijelu sobu, a čvrstog spavača često ni ne probudi. Pametni sat košta nekoliko stotina eura i treba ga puniti gotovo svaki dan. NORIKS WakeBand ima jedan zadatak – da vas probudi na vrijeme – i radi ga tiho, na vašem zapešću.</p><p class="wswakeband__p">Nema aplikacije, nema Bluetootha, nema mobitela pod jastukom. Alarm postavite izravno na narukvici, a baterija traje do 14 dana s jednim punjenjem.</p><ul class="wswakeband__kv"><li>Budi samo vas, ne cijelu kuću</li><li>Napravljena za čvrste spavače</li><li>Baterija do 14 dana</li><li>Jednokratni trošak, bez pretplate</li></ul><p class="wswakeband__zak">Bez rizika: isprobajte je kod kuće, a ako vam ne odgovara, imate 30 dana za povrat.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="wswakeband__s wswakeband__s--bg"><div class="wswakeband__v"><div class="wswakeband__kicker wswakeband__c">Iskustva kupaca</div><h2 class="wswakeband__h2 wswakeband__c">Kako NORIKS WakeBand pomaže ljudima da <em>ustanu na vrijeme</em></h2><p class="wswakeband__p wswakeband__c">Prosječna ocjena 4,8 od 5 – evo što kažu kupci koji su prešli s glasne budilice na vibraciju.</p><div class="wswakeband__grid wswakeband__g3"><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__km"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-kupac-goran.webp' ); ?>" alt="Ne budim više suprugu u 4 ujutro" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div class="wswakeband__kt"><span class="wswakeband__zv">★★★★★</span><strong>Ne budim više suprugu u 4 ujutro</strong><p>Kupio sam je da ne budim suprugu kad moram ustati u 4. Sitnica, ali iskreno je promijenila jutra – lagana je i stvarno dobro napravljena.</p><span class="wswakeband__ime"><i class="wswakeband__av" aria-hidden="true">G</i>Goran M.</span></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__km"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-kupac-kristina.webp' ); ?>" alt="Konačno nešto što me budi" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div class="wswakeband__kt"><span class="wswakeband__zv">★★★★★</span><strong>Konačno nešto što me budi</strong><p>Spavam jako čvrsto i obična budilica me jednostavno ne probudi. Narukvica me budi bez problema i bez buke za cimere. Buđenje je puno ugodnije.</p><span class="wswakeband__ime"><i class="wswakeband__av" aria-hidden="true">K</i>Kristina K.</span></div></div><div class="wswakeband__k"><div class="wswakeband__km"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-kupac-antonio.webp' ); ?>" alt="Tri glasna alarma nisu pomogla, ovo jest" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div class="wswakeband__kt"><span class="wswakeband__zv">★★★★★</span><strong>Tri glasna alarma nisu pomogla, ovo jest</strong><p>Imao sam tri glasna alarma koja su budila suprugu u drugoj sobi, ali ne i mene. Odlučio sam probati ovu narukvicu i na meni radi odlično.</p><span class="wswakeband__ime"><i class="wswakeband__av" aria-hidden="true">A</i>Antonio V.</span></div></div></div><p class="wswakeband__zak">Ocjena 4,8 – i jutra bez prespavanja.</p></div></section>
<section class="wswakeband__s"><div class="wswakeband__v wswakeband__dva"><div class="wswakeband__media"><img src="<?php echo esc_url( get_template_directory_uri() . '/img/wakeband/noriks-wakeband-na-zapescu.webp' ); ?>" alt="Sve što trebate znati" loading="eager" decoding="async"></div><div><div class="wswakeband__kicker">Pitanja</div><h2 class="wswakeband__h2">Sve što trebate <em>znati</em></h2><p class="wswakeband__p">Najčešća pitanja koja dobivamo prije kupnje – kratko i bez okolišanja.</p><ol class="wswakeband__tocke"><li><span class="wswakeband__st">01</span><div><strong>Hoće li me ovo stvarno probuditi?</strong><p>Da. Vibracija na zapešću djeluje drugačije od zvuka – to je fizički osjet koji mozak ne može tek tako ignorirati. Zato ju čvrsti spavači osjete i kad zvuk prespavaju.</p></div></li><li><span class="wswakeband__st">02</span><div><strong>Što ako mi ne odgovara?</strong><p>Imate 30 dana za povrat novca. Ako NORIKS WakeBand nije za vas, jednostavno ga vratite.</p></div></li><li><span class="wswakeband__st">03</span><div><strong>Kako stiže paket?</strong><p>Dostava je besplatna za narudžbe iznad 70 €, a platiti možete pouzećem – kad paket stigne na vašu adresu.</p></div></li></ol><p class="wswakeband__zak">Još pitanja? Odgovore o punjenju, vodootpornosti i alarmima naći ćete u pitanjima ispod recenzija.</p></div></div></section>
